  "ruleText": "Ncr 306.01 Petitions for Designating an Exemplary Natural Community. All petitions for designating exemplary natural communities shall conform to the requirements set out in Ncr 306.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
